1
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:09,960
Sir,

2
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,520
you're back.

3
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,760
Are you tired from the trip?

4
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:38,840
Dad!

5
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:41,520
Yu,

6
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,900
you're finally awake.

7
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:46,960
That's great.

8
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,680
I rushed back from abroad

9
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,440
as soon as I heard the news.

10
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,680
Come here.

11
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:54,140
Sorry to have worried you.

12
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:56,200
How are you feeling?

13
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,330
Everything is fine.

14
00:01:57,479 --> 00:01:58,280
Good.

15
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,480
That puts my mind at ease.

16
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:05,080
I must hurry and reunite with my dad.

17
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,400
Come in.

18
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,880
Please enjoy, sir.

19
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,880
My wife told me

20
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,360
the He family hired a personal maid

21
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,480
to take care of He Yu.

22
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:31,280
Named Li Zhangxin.

23
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,400
Is that you?

24
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:34,960
Yes.

25
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,320
Sir,

26
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,600
you must be exhausted

27
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,860
from the long journey.

28
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,240
And you still have to work
after coming back.

29
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,970
Let me massage your shoulders.

30
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,520
Sure.

31
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:56,880
I don't know why,

32
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,560
but I feel

33
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,560
especially close to you.

34
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,800
Me too.

35
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:07,040
Maybe

36
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:10,160
we share a special bond.

37
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:14,160
But I heard from Mrs. He

38
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,370
that your family isn't very well-off.

39
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,240
I grew up in the countryside.

40
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,180
My adoptive father took me in.

41
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,600
But he didn't treat me well.

42
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,800
He only took me in

43
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,640
to make me his daughter-in-law.

44
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,440
If

45
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:33,120
I had a father like you,

46
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,360
I would be so happy.

47
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,620
I really didn't expect

48
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,560
you to have such a rough past.

49
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,600
You poor child.

50
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:45,079
Once I get Dad's hair

51
00:03:45,079 --> 00:03:46,800
for a DNA test,

52
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,120
I can prove I'm He Mei.

53
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:50,560
Sir,

54
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,040
let me massage your head.

55
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,100
What are you doing?

56
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,360
I'm massaging Sir's shoulders.

57
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:17,240
You shameless thing.

58
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:19,519
You've been sucking up to Sir
ever since he got back.

59
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,200
Don't think I don't know

60
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,530
what you're up to, you little seductress.

61
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,820
Don't be so harsh on the newcomer.

62
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,080
As you wish.

63
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,080
You can go back first.

64
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,280
So the homewrecker

65
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,290
is also afraid of being cheated on.

66
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,320
You,

67
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,440
come with me.

68
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,800
I'm almost fully recovered now,

69
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,240
and I don't need you anymore.

70
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,480
I'll tell Mrs. He.

71
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,560
You can leave the He family now.

72
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,840
I'll give you

73
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,300
double the compensation.

74
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,280
I'm not leaving.

75
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,160
First you approached me,

76
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,480
and now you're approaching my dad.

77
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,520
You're openly going against
Mrs. He and my brother.

78
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,640
What is your purpose?

79
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,760
If you entered the He family

80
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,560
just to climb the social ladder,

81
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,680
then I suggest you

82
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,400
stop asking for trouble.

83
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,440
Oh no.

84
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,440
How could I let him misunderstand me?

85
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,240
Looks like

86
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,960
I'll have to shut him up first.

87
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,320
I do have a motive.

88
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,520
My goal

89
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:36,920
is you.

90
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,800
I pleased Master He

91
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:45,080
because he is my future father-in-law.

92
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:47,400
You hate Madam He
and the eldest young master,

93
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,680
so I hate them too.

94
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,840
Don't even think about it.

95
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:55,080
You're not my type.

96
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,480
Then what type

97
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,810
does the second young master like?

98
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,600
I don't know.

99
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:04,900
You don't know?

100
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,840
How would you know

101
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,640
if you don't try?

102
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,640
I advise you

103
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,760
to give up on this path.

104
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,300
I know you are prejudiced against me,

105
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,520
but it won't be long

106
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,320
before you change your mind.

107
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:44,880
Next,

108
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:47,640
I just need to wait
for the DNA test results from the agency,

109
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,640
and I can smoothly reunite with Dad.

110
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:58,840
I feel like

111
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:00,440
this girl, Li Zhangxin,

112
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,320
is pretty good.

113
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,640
Sir,

114
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:07,940
you can know a person's face
but not their heart.

115
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,520
How long has she been in the He family?

116
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:13,760
I don't even know her well enough yet.

117
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,920
You dared to bring her into the house

118
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,780
without knowing her well enough?

119
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,320
That's not what I meant.

120
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,800
After all, women

121
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,760
are good at pretending.

122
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,480
You always mention other women around me,

123
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:35,360
and I'm getting jealous.

124
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,240
Sir,

125
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,740
you've had a long and tiring journey.

126
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:43,080
Let me welcome you back
and help you freshen up.

127
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,440
I'm a bit tired today.

128
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:53,050
Let's just leave it at that for now.

129
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:56,920
As you wish.

130
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,920
This Mr. He

131
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,850
is really getting worse and worse.

132
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:06,400
Stop it, I'm not in the mood.

133
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,800
You know how it is.

134
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,120
That old man

135
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,960
locks himself in the study
as soon as he gets back,

136
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,200
for a whole day.

137
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,840
Still no.

138
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,560
I'm leaving.

139
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,960
Are you sure you can handle
the loneliness?

140
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,600
Get lost.

141
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,159
Come here.

142
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,720
Let me tell you,

143
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:41,000
we need to drug Li Zhangxin's drink.

144
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,320
Put this

145
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:50,680
in Li Zhangxin's water.

146
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:52,640
I have my own arrangements

147
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,040
for what comes next.
